igibility', 'Features And Limits', 'Fees And Charges', 'General Inquiries', 'Interest And Rates', 'Payments And Transfers', 'Profile Updates', 'Rewards And Promotions', 'Transaction Disputes'], 'Horizon_APP': ['Account Management', 'Authentication And Security', 'Features And Limits', 'General Inquiries', 'Payments And Transfers', 'Profile Updates', 'Rewards And Promotions'], 'Insurance': ['Features And Limits', 'General Inquiries', 'Rewards And Promotions', 'Wealth And Insurance'], 'Mutual_Funds': ['Fees And Charges', 'General Inquiries', 'Wealth And Insurance'], 'Personal_Loan': ['Account Management', 'Application', 'Authentication And Security', 'Eligibility', 'Features And Limits', 'Fees And Charges', 'General Inquiries', 'Interest And Rates', 'Loan And Credit Management', 'Rewards And Promotions'], 'Rewards_Program': ['Authentication And Security', 'Features And Limits', 'General Inquiries', 'Payments And Transfers', 'Rewards And Promotions'], 'Stocks': ['Fees And Charges', 'General Inquiries', 'Wealth And Insurance']}\n\n    INTENT DEFINITION GUIDELINE:\n    \n1. Acquisition & Setup (Getting Started)\nApplication: How to apply, steps involved, document submission, or checking status. \nEligibility: Qualify for a product, income/age requirements, existing relationships. \nCard Logistics: Physical handling. Activation, delivery, reporting lost/stolen, replacement. \n2. Product Knowledge (Understanding the Asset)\nFeatures And Limits: General mechanics, benefits, usage limits, overseas use, digital wallets. \nFees And Charges: Costs, annual fees, fall-below fees, penalties, fee waivers. \nInterest And Rates: Interest accumulation, base rates, bonus criteria, payout timing. \n3. Daily Servicing (Account & Money Movement)\nAccount Management: Checking balances, dormancy, linking accounts, account cancellation. \nProfile Updates: Address, phone number, and email updates. \nPayments And Transfers: PayNow, FAST, GIRO, bill payments, cheque deposits, transfer errors. \