{"timestamp": "2026-08-30T08:44:42.378+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_6444d165-557f-471e-aff4-5206cd1fe77a", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently for whether its supplied\n        parents are response-ready: they must contain enough materially\n        relevant, grounded information for the assistant to give the customer\n        a useful FAQ response.\n\n        Original User Message (advisory context only; never use it as an\n        individual task's completeness target): What privileges come with premium banking?\n        Trusted Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nNone\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nAI: Welcome back, Benson! How can I help with your banking today? Also, you still have 7 pending requests (Resubmit KYC Document and Change Address) — you can check them anytime from the requests icon in the top right.\nUser: i want to buy a car, what can you do for me\nAI: 🚗 I don't have information available regarding what car financing or loan products the bank offers.\nUser: can i use credit card to buy a car\nAI: 💳 I don't have information available regarding whether you can use a credit card to purchase a car.\nUser: what do you have\nAI: Here is an overview of the initial financial products and services we provide to our customers:\n\nHorizon Bank offers an initial suite of products and services, featuring the following:\nA Horizon credit card\nA savings account\nPersonal accident insurance for families\nA best-in-class rewards and loyalty program seamlessly integrated with the FairPrice Group ecosystem\nExclusive deals and additional savings opportunities through collaborations with prominen