{"timestamp": "2026-08-30T08:49:13.895+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_6444d165-557f-471e-aff4-5206cd1fe77a", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        INCREMENTAL TOOL-CALLING PLANNER\n        You must plan tool tasks to address the customer's financial subqueries.\n        For each subquery listed under \"Subqueries with a remaining gap this\n        round\" below, decide which registered, enabled tool(s) are\n        genuinely RELEVANT -- whose own description actually matches what\n        the customer needs -- and propose a task for each one that applies.\n        Judge relevance only; do not weigh cost yourself.\n\n        Tool cost characteristics (for the \"rag_role\" decision below only):\n        - \"api\", \"deeplink\", and \"service_request\" are each a single,\n          deterministic operation -- effectively free once dispatched.\n        - \"rag\" requires an internal iterative retrieval process that can\n          take several rounds and several model calls to converge -- the\n          only tool with real cost.\n\n        Financial subqueries: [{\"subquery_id\": \"subquery_1\", \"customer_component\": \"What are the requirements and features of the standard banking tier?\"}]\n        Subqueries with a remaining gap this round: [\"subquery_1\"]\n        Validated terminal tool results: []\n        Enabled tool registry: [{\"tool_name\": \"rag\", \"operations\": [\"retrieve_faq_evidence\"], \"description\": \"Retrieve and verify Horizon FAQ and policy evidence.\", \"read_only\": true}, {\"tool_name\": \"service_request\", \"operations\": [\"register_service_request\"], \"description\": \"Register a guided, multi-step form for an approved low- or intermediate-risk service request (e.g. address update, card replacement, KYC document resubmission). Never used for money movement or high-risk actions -- those are deeplink's job.\", \"read_only\": false, \"available_requests\": [{\"service_request_id\": \"profile-address-update\", \"description\": \"Submit a new postal address for the customer's profile.\", \"risk_level\": \"low\"}, {\"service_request_id\": \"card-replacement-request\", \"description\": \"Request a replacement physical card for a non-fraud reason (worn or damaged).\", \"risk_level\": \"low\"}, {\"service_request_id\": \"kyc-document-resubmission\", \"description\": \"Resubmit an identity document for an existing customer's KYC record.\", \"risk_level\": \"intermediate\"}]}, {\"tool_name\": \"api\", \"operations\": [\"read_customer_data\"], \"description\": \"Read one specific, verified piece of the customer's own banking data on file (e.g. their address, their loyalty tier). Use this for a request about the customer's actual personal data value, not a general policy or procedure question -- that is RAG's job.\", \"read_only\": true, \"available_fields\": [{\"field_id\": \"profile-address\", \"description\": \"The customer's current postal address on file.\", \"disclosure_mode\": \"placeholder\"}, {\"field_id\": \"loyalty-status\", \"description\": \"The customer's current loyalty program tier.\", \"disclosure_mode\": \"direct_value\"}]}, {\"tool_name\": \"deeplink\", \"operations\": [\"resolve_navigation\"], \"description\": \"Return a validated Horizon navigation destination. Use this when the customer needs to navigate to a specific screen in the app.\", \"read_only\": true, \"available_destinations\": [{\"destination_id\": \"card-management\", \"description\": \"View & Manage Card screen — freeze, replace, enable overseas usage.\", \"route\": \"/app/cards/manage\", \"label\": \"Manage Card\"}, {\"destination_id\": \"account-statements\", \"description\": \"Statements screen — view and download past monthly statements.\", \"route\": \"/app/accounts/statements\", \"label\": \"View Statements\"}, {\"destination_id\": \"profile-personal-details\", \"description\": \"Profile -> Personal Details screen — view and edit name, address, phone, ema