{"timestamp": "2026-08-30T12:41:18.955+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_63fc6657-0752-4f75-8a61-a62a31d2792b", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently for whether its supplied\n        parents are response-ready: they must contain enough materially\n        relevant, grounded information for the assistant to give the customer\n        a useful FAQ response.\n\n        Original User Message (advisory context only; never use it as an\n        individual task's completeness target): how to apply for a loan. And have you got your answer for the question? not the ones in the greeting\n        Trusted Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nNone\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nAI: Welcome back, Benson! How can I help with your banking today? Also, you still have 7 pending requests (Resubmit KYC Document and Change Address) — you can check them anytime from the requests icon in the top right.\n\nWould you like to continue with your application for an Instant Loan?\nUser: how to apply for a loan. And have you got your answer for the question? not the ones in the greeting\n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"procedural\": \"Submit the online application form with your personal identification and income documents for verification.\", \"policy\": \"Applicants must meet minimum age and annual income requirements to qualify for a personal loan.\", \"conceptual\": \"A personal loan provides a lump sum of cash repaid in fixed monthly installments over time.\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Personal_Loan\", \"target_intent\": [\"Application\"], \"customer_component\": \"How to apply for a loan.\", \"direct_query\": \"How to apply for a loan.\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_1\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Submit the online application form with your personal identification and income documents for verification.\", \"policy\": \"Applicants must meet minimum age and annual income requirements to qualify for a personal loan.\", \"conceptual\": \"A personal loan provides a lump sum of cash repaid in fixed monthly installments over time.\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_75ed6e4d\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the typical timeframe for my loan to be approved?\\n\\nAnswer: - The vast majority of loans are approved and the amount is deposited into your Horizon savings account in about {{faq_75ed6e4d_001}} seconds.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_f9cce3c1\", \"content\": \"Question: If my Instant Loan request is declined, can I still submit applications for other Horizon Bank products such as a credit card or a savings account?\\n\\nAnswer: - Absolutely. A declined loan does not prevent you from applying for other Horizon Bank offerings. You simply need to start a new application tailored to the specific product you wish to obtain.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_46c17d0e\", \"content\": \"Question: What steps do I need to take to initiate a balance transfer request with Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: To begin the balance transfer process, navigate to the Horizon App, select the 'More' option, and then proceed to the 'Loan' section, where you will find 'Other Flexible Loans' to commence your application.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Each Task Input contains `task.customer_component`: the intent\n          formulator's resolved sub-query for that task. Evaluate a task ONLY\n          against its own `customer_component` and that task's candidate\n          parents. `customer_component` may already be elaborated with\n          ret