nal coverage and unresolved-topic anchors\n    only; not evidence, response wording, or UI guidance):\n    {\"subquery_status\": {\"subquery_1\": \"RESOLVED\"}}\n    Approved evidence by retrieval task: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"resolved_request\": \"How can I purchase stocks through Horizon Bank?\", \"approved_parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_4bd34aa4\", \"content\": \"Question: At Horizon Bank, what is the lowest investment threshold for purchasing securities?\\n\\nAnswer: With Horizon Bank, you have the flexibility to initiate your investment portfolio by buying stocks and ETFs with a minimum investment of just USD {{faq_4bd34aa4_001}}.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_502da680\", \"content\": \"Question: What are the initial steps to begin buying and selling securities with Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: To initiate trading activities, it is necessary to establish a securities trading account. This can be accomplished by navigating to the Horizon App, selecting the Investments option, and then choosing the Stocks feature. Upon doing so, adhere to the on-screen prompts to finalize the account setup. Please be aware that the approval to open this account is contingent upon an internal evaluation conducted by Horizon Bank.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_c8d61dc6\", \"content\": \"Question: What investment opportunities are available through Horizon Bank's stock trading services?\\n\\nAnswer: Horizon Bank provides its clients with the ability to engage in trading activities involving stocks and exchange-traded funds listed on US exchanges, in addition to a selection of UK UCITS exchange-traded funds.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_e94ad933\", \"content\": \"Question: What are the eligibility criteria for creating a Stocks account with Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: To be eligible for a Stocks account, you must meet the following conditions: \\n      * You should have an active Savings account with Horizon Bank. If you haven't already, you can easily open one through the Horizon App.\\n 