estion MUST trace back to a specific piece of Approved evidence\n      you were already given this turn -- never invent a topic beyond it,\n      and never suggest something you have no evidence for; this is not a\n      guess about what the customer might want, it is a pointer to real\n      content already sitting in front of you that you chose not to use.\n      This is optional: leave `next_actions` empty when everything\n      materially relevant in your approved evidence was already covered,\n      or there is no genuine unfeatured content to point to -- do not\n      invent a suggestion merely to fill the array. Phrase each as a\n      short, natural question or request in the customer's own voice, the\n      way they would actually type it (never a bare topic label) -- e.g.\n      \"What are the eligibility requirements for this loan?\" not\n      \"Eligibility\".\n\n    Output JSON only:\n    {\"elements\":[{\"type\":\"TEXT|LIST|PROGRESS|COMPARISON|ACCORDION|TIMELINE|CAROUSEL|ALERT\",\"source_task_ids\":[\"task_1\"],\"context_text\":\"optional natural connector\",\"answer\":\"grounded prose\",\"title\":\"optional component title\",\"list_title\":\"only for LIST\",\"list_items\":[\"only for LIST\"],\"progress_title\":\"only for PROGRESS\",\"progress_steps\":[{\"title\":\"...\",\"detail\":\"...\"}],\"headers\":[\"for COMPARISON\"],\"rows\":[{\"feature\":\"...\",\"values\":[\"...\"]}],\"actions\":[{\"label\":\"...\",\"action\":\"...\"}],\"sections\":[{\"title\":\"...\",\"content\":\"...\"}],\"subtitle\":\"for TIMELINE\",\"steps\":[{\"title\":\"...\",\"description\":\"...\",\"status\":\"completed|active|pending\",\"date\":\"...\"}],\"items\":[{\"title\":\"...\",\"subtitle\":\"...\",\"badge\":\"...\",\"highlight\":\"...\",\"details\":[\"...\"],\"actionLabel\":\"...\",\"actionMessage\":\"...\"}],\"severity\":\"warning|security|info|success\",\"message\":\"for ALERT\",\"action\":{\"label\":\"...\",\"action\":\"...\"},\"extended_text\":\"optional additional grounde