ances without any conditions.\\n- **Spend‑bonus:**\\n  - {{faq_bf86ef1f_004}} p.a. for members of the Horizon Union, provided you complete at least five qualifying card purchases in the month.\\n  - {{faq_bf86ef1f_005}} p.a. for non‑Union members, also requiring five qualifying transactions.\\n- **Balance‑bonus:** {{faq_bf86ef1f_006}} p.a. when your average daily balance for the month reaches {{faq_bf86ef1f_007}} or more.\\n- **Salary‑bonus:** {{faq_bf86ef1f_008}} p.a. if you receive a minimum salary credit of {{faq_bf86ef1f_009}} in a single GIRO transaction (purpose code SALA) during the month.\\nAny amount exceeding {{faq_bf86ef1f_010}} earns only the base rate of {{faq_bf86ef1f_011}} p.a. Interest is posted on the final day of each month.\\n\\n**Illustrative calculation (December, {{faq_bf86ef1f_012}}‑day month):**\\nAssume you maintain a daily balance of {{faq_bf86ef1f_013}}, complete five qualifying card purchases of at least {{faq_bf86ef1f_014}} each on {{faq_bf86ef1f_015}} Dec, and have a {{faq_bf86ef1f_016}} salary credit on {{faq_bf86ef1f_017}} Dec.\\n- **Union member scenario**\\n  - Base on first {{faq_bf86ef1f_018}} M: {{faq_bf86ef1f_019}} × {{faq_bf86ef1f_020}} × {{faq_bf86ef1f_021}}/{{faq_bf86ef1f_022}} = {{faq_bf86ef1f_023}}\\n  - Spend‑bonus: {{faq_bf86ef1f_024}} × {{faq_bf86ef1f_025}} × {{faq_bf86ef1f_026}}/{{faq_bf86ef1f_027}} = {{faq_bf86ef1f_028}}\\n  - Balance‑bonus: {{faq_bf86ef1f_029}} × {{faq_bf86ef1f_030}} × {{faq_bf86ef1f_031}}/{{faq_bf86ef1f_032}} = {{faq_bf86ef1f_033}}\\n  - Salary‑bonus: {{faq_bf86ef1f_034}} × {{faq_bf86ef1f_035}} × {{faq_bf86ef1f_036}}/{{faq_bf86ef1f_037}} = {{faq_bf86ef1f_038}}\\n  - Base on excess {{faq_bf86ef1f_039}}: {{faq_bf86ef1f_040}} × {{faq_bf86ef1f_041}} × {{faq_bf86ef1f_042}}/{{faq_bf86ef1f_043}} = {{faq_bf86ef1f_044}}\\n  - **Total interest:** {{faq_bf86ef1f_045}}\\n- **Non‑Union member scenario**\\n  - Base on first {{faq_bf86ef1f_046}} M: {{faq_bf86ef1f_047}} × {{faq_bf86ef1f_048}} × {{faq_bf86ef1f_049}}/