{"timestamp": "2026-08-30T18:17:31.861+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_7106726e-173f-4ec3-970b-2c67029166c9", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently for whether its supplied\n        parents are response-ready: they must contain enough materially\n        relevant, grounded information for the assistant to give the customer\n        a useful FAQ response.\n\n        Original User Message (advisory context only; never use it as an\n        individual task's completeness target): how to open a bank account, what's the process\n        Trusted Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nNone\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nAI: Welcome back, Benson! How can I help with your banking today? Also, you still have 4 pending requests (Resubmit KYC Document and Change Address) — you can check them anytime from the requests icon in the top right.\n\nWould you like to continue looking into personal loan interest rates?\nUser: have you watch TV last night?\nAI: As an AI, I don't watch TV, but I'm ready to help you with any banking questions you have today! 📺\nUser: do you have any opinion about the recent Trump activity?\nAI: I'm here to help you with your banking needs and questions, but I don't follow or share opinions on political topics! 😊 Let me know if there's anything account-related you'd like to look into today.\nUser: then can you give me investment opinion?\nAI: For compliance reasons, I’m unable to fulfil that request. Could you try rephrasing your question, or asking about something else?\nUser: how to open a bank account, what's the process\n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"procedural\": \"Complete the online application form, submit required identification documents, and verify your identity through the mobile app.\", \"policy\": \"Applicants must be at least eighteen years old and hold valid government-issued identification to open an account.\", \"conceptual\": \"A deposit account is a financial product that allows individuals to securely store money, earn interest, and manage transactions.\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Deposit_Account\", \"target_intent\": [\"Account Management\", \"Application\", \"Authentication And Security\", \"Branch And ATM Locator\", \"Card Logistics\", \"Eligibility\", \"Features And Limits\", \"Fees And Charges\", \"General Inquiries\", \"Interest And Rates\", \"Payments And Transfers\", \"Profile Updates\", \"Rewards And Promotions\", \"Transaction Disputes\"], \"customer_component\": \"How to open a bank account and what is the process for doing so?\", \"direct_query\": \"How to open a bank account and what is the process for doing so?\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_1\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Complete the online application form, submit required identification documents, and verify your identity through the mobile app.\", \"policy\": \"Applicants must be at least eighteen years old and hold valid government-issued identification to open an account.\", \"conceptual\": \"A deposit account is a financial product that allows individuals to securely store money, earn interest, and manage transactions.\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [\"faq_70aebcd6\"], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [{\"attempt\": 1, \"status\": \"PARTIALLY_SUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [\"faq_70aebcd6\"], \"reason\": \"The supplied parent provides specific information regarding the tools (mobile phone) and verification method (MyInfo) required to open a Savings Account, which is a material part of the process for opening a bank account.\", \"evidence_delta\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_70aebcd6\", \"fact\": \"Opening a Savings Account requires a mobile phone and MyInfo verification to auto-populate the application form.\"}]}], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_10f9fec0\", \"content\": \"Question: What are the requirements to open a new Horizon Bank account?\\n\\nAnswer: To initiate the application process for a Horizon Bank account, simply utilize your mobile device and authenticate through MyInfo, which will expedite the pre-filling of your application in a secure manner. For non-Singaporean residents, please be prepared to upload a valid passport and relevant income documentation, particularly if you are applying for a Horizon credit card.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_cc2bb0f9\", \"content\": \"Question: What prerequisites must I meet to open a Savings Account with Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: - A mobile device and MyInfo authentication are sufficient to auto‑populate your application form.\\n- If you delete or reinstall the Horizon App after completing registration, you will still need to use SingPass to verify your identity when you log in again.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_098d72b7\", \"content\": \"Question: Is it possible to open a Savings Account with Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: - You may apply for a Horizon Bank Savings Account if you satisfy both of the following conditions:\\n  {{faq_098d72b7_001}}. You are a Singapore citizen, a Singapore permanent resident, or a foreign national holding a valid work pass;\\n  {{faq_098d72b7_002}}. You are at least {{faq_098d72b7_003}} years old.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_46c43248\", \"content\": \"Question: Can I open a Savings Account with Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: - You are eligible to apply for a Horizon Bank Savings Account if you meet both of the following criteria:\\n  {{faq_46c43248_001}}. You are a Singapore citizen, a Singapore permanent resident, or a foreign national holding a valid work pass.\\n  {{faq_46c43248_002}}. You are {{faq_46c43248_003}} years of age or older.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_70aebcd6\", \"content\": \"Question: What information and tools are necessary to open a Savings Account with Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: - A mobile phone together with MyInfo verification to auto‑populate your application form.\\n- If you delete or reinstall the Horizon App after successfully registering, you will still need to authenticate via SingPass when you log in again.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Each Task Input contains `task.customer_component`: the intent\n          formulator's resolved sub-query for that task. Evaluate a task ONLY\n          against its own `customer_component` and that task's candidate\n          parents. `customer_component` may already be elaborated with\n          retrieval-oriented wording the customer never actually said, so\n          if you set `unresolved_term` below, derive it by reasoning\n          directly against Original User Message and Trusted Conversation\n          Context instead -- never by quoting `customer_component` back --\n          a clarifying question must quote something the customer will\n          recognize as their own.\n        - Each Task Input may include `prior_sufficiency_audit_history` from\n          earlier attempts for the same task in this turn. Read it before\n          judging the current candidates and remain consistent with its prior\n          sufficiency judgments. This history is internal audit context only;\n          it is not customer-facing evidence and does not authorize any new\n          factual claim.\n        - Classify each task as SUFFICIENT, PARTIALLY_SUFFICIENT, or\n          INSUFFICIENT. Judge whether the supplied parents provide useful,\n          materially relevant information for the task—not whether they repeat\n          the customer's wording or explicitly resolve every possible\n          interpretation of the customer's question.\n        - PARTIAL-EVIDENCE DECISION ORDER: First identify whether any supplied\n          parent contains