e adequate unused credit limit.\\n- **For new applicants:**\\n  * Singapore citizens, permanent residents, and foreign nationals are all permitted to apply for the Instant Loan.\\n  * Every submission will be subject to Horizon Bank’s credit‑worthiness assessment.\\n\\nYou may request a credit facility provided you satisfy the following criteria:\\n- You are aged between {{faq_0ae0bb51_001}} and {{faq_0ae0bb51_002}} years.\\n- Your annual income is at least {{faq_0ae0bb51_003}} if you are a Singapore citizen or permanent resident.\\n- Your annual income is at least {{faq_0ae0bb51_004}} if you are a foreigner holding a valid work pass.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_1_scope_scope_scope\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1_scope_scope_scope\", \"mapping_reason\": \"Type 2: The sufficiency auditor flagged candidate parent faq_0ae0bb51 regarding Instant Loan eligibility. Since the user is inquiring about personal loan interest rates, exploring the Loan and Credit Management intent for Personal Loans provides an adjacent path to understanding how interest is applied to existing credit balances.\", \"procedural\": \"Review repayment schedule, calculate monthly installments, check balance transfer options\", \"policy\": \"Late payment penalties, early settlement fees, minimum monthly repayment requirements\", \"conceptual\": \"Amortization schedules, interest calculation methods, loan tenure impacts\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Personal_Loan\", \"target_intent\": [\"Loan And Credit Management\"], \"search_territory\": \"adjacent_scope\", \"source_task_id\": \"task_1_scope_scope\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_1\", \"customer_component\": \"What is the current interest rate for a personal loan?\", \"direct_query\": \"What is the current interest rate for a personal loan?\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Review repayment schedule, calculate monthly installments, check balance transfer options\", \"policy\": \"Late payment penalties, early set