{"timestamp": "2026-08-31T06:27:40.296+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_6331e5ee-f48c-41ca-b6b1-85ff51cb8bb7", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently for whether its supplied\n        parents are response-ready: they must contain enough materially\n        relevant, grounded information for the assistant to give the customer\n        a useful FAQ response.\n\n        Original User Message (advisory context only; never use it as an\n        individual task's completeness target): i want to buy a car\n        Trusted Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nNone\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nAI: Welcome back, Benson! How can I help with your banking today? Also, you still have 3 pending Resubmit KYC Document requests — you can check them anytime from the requests icon in the top right.\n\nWould you like to continue with opening your savings account?\nUser: i want to buy a car\n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"mapping_reason\": \"The customer is inquiring about financing for a car purchase, which maps to the Personal_Loan product family and the Application intent for initiating a loan request.\", \"procedural\": \"Submit your loan application through our mobile app or visit a branch with your income documents.\", \"policy\": \"Loan approval is subject to meeting our minimum income requirements and credit assessment criteria for individual applicants.\", \"conceptual\": \"A personal loan provides a lump sum of cash for major purchases, repaid in fixed monthly installments.\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Personal_Loan\", \"target_intent\": [\"Account Management\", \"Application\", \"Authentication And Security\", \"Eligibility\", \"Features And Limits\", \"Fees And Charges\", \"General Inquiries\", \"Interest And Rates\", \"Loan And Credit Management\", \"Rewards And Promotions\"], \"search_territory\": \"in_scope\", \"customer_component\": \"I would like to inquire about financing options for purchasing a car.\", \"direct_query\": \"I would like to inquire about financing options for purchasing a car.\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_1\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Submit your loan application through our mobile app or visit a branch with your income documents.\", \"policy\": \"Loan approval is subject to meeting our minimum income requirements and credit assessment criteria for individual applicants.\", \"conceptual\": \"A personal loan provides a lump sum of cash for major purchases, repaid in fixed monthly installments.\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [{\"attempt\": 1, \"status\": \"INSUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [], \"reason\": \"The supplied parents provide information about an 'Instant Loan' product, which is a specific credit facility, but they do not provide information on general car financing or personal loans for vehicle purchases. The information provided is not materially relevant to the customer's request for car financing.\", \"evidence_delta\": []}], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_1946c44f\", \"content\": \"Question: What steps should I follow to request an Instant Loan from Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: - Open the Horizon App, go to the **Money** menu, and select **Loan** to initiate the process.\\n- If you are not yet a Horizon customer, first download the Horizon App, then navigate to **Product Selection** and choose **Instant Loan** to begin your application.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_5deed8da\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the process for repaying my Horizon Bank loan?\\n\\nAnswer: - The loan installment is automatically posted to your Horizon credit card statement each month, and you can clear it via that statement.\\n- Open the Horizon App, navigate to Money → Credit Card, and select Pay Credit Card.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_2109a75e\", \"content\": \"Question: How does Horizon Bank calculate the monthly payment for my loan?\\n\\nAnswer: - The monthly payment is computed by summing the approved principal amount with the total interest that will accrue over the loan term, and then dividing that combined figure by the total number of months in the loan period. For additional details, please consult the Horizon Instant Loan Terms & Conditions.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_952e4559\", \"content\": \"Question: What does Horizon Bank’s Instant Loan product involve?\\n\\nAnswer: Instant Loan is a Horizon Bank offering in Singapore that enables you to convert a portion of the available credit on your Horizon credit card into cash.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_1_scope\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1_scope\", \"mapping_reason\": \"Type 1: Reasoning from the Product/Intent Matrix and context. Since the user is interested in a major purchase like a car, they may also need to manage their existing cash flow or savings to prepare for the down payment, which maps to the Deposit_Account product family and the Account Management intent.\", \"procedural\": \"Link your savings account to your mobile banking profile for easier balance monitoring and fund transfers.\", \"policy\": \"Maintain the required minimum monthly average balance to avoid incurring any fall-below service fees.\", \"conceptual\": \"A deposit account serves as a secure repository for your liquid funds intended for future financial commitments.\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Deposit_Account\", \"target_intent\": [\"Account Management\", \"Features And Limits\"], \"search_territory\": \"adjacent_scope\", \"source_task_id\": \"task_1\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_1\", \"customer_component\": \"I would like to inquire about financing options for purchasing a car.\", \"direct_query\": \"I would like to inquire about financing options for purchasing a car.\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Link your savings account to your mobile banking profile for easier balance monitoring and fund transfers.\", \"policy\": \"Maintain the required minimum monthly average balance to avoid incurring any fall-below service fees.\", \"conceptual\": \"A deposit account serves as a secure repository for your liquid funds intended for future financial commitments.\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_7b5e0f27\", \"content\": \"Question: What three savings‑plan choices does Horizon Bank provide for its deposit accounts?\\n\\nAnswer: - Horizon Bank now lets you select a savings plan that determines the interest applied to the balance in your savings account. The three available options are **Signature**, **Zen**, and **Flex**.\\n- You may switch your plan at any time before the month ends; the new selection takes effect on the {{faq_7b5e0f27_001}}st day of the following month.\\n- Each successful change triggers an in‑app push notification and an email alert.\\n- To see which plan is currently active, open the **Horizon App**, navigate to **Savings > Interest This Month**, where you can also monitor your progress toward any bonus interest tied to the chosen plan.\\n- If you do not make a change during a given month, the existing plan automatically rolls over into the next month.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_48ced7a5\", \"content\": \"Question: What can I do with a Horizon Bank Savings Account?\\n\\nAnswer: - The Horizon Bank Savings Account is denominated in Singapore dollars (SGD) and is designed for both saving and routine financial activities.\\n- Store funds in SGD.\\n- Settle everyday purchases in SGD using your Horizon card or a PayNow QR code.\\n- Access cash at any Standard Chartered ATM using the Horizon card.\\n- Send or receive SGD to and from other banks via FAST, PayNow, incoming GIRO, or salary crediting.\\n- Pay off outstanding balances on your Horizon credit card either through scheduled autopay or one‑time payments.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_d1152d2a\", \"content\": \"Question: How can I opt out of the premium services offered by Horizon Bank, and what are the conditions for maintaining this status?\\n\\nAnswer: To clarify, your elevated status with Horizon Bank remains active for a period of {{faq_d1152d2a_001}} months from the date you initially qualify. In order to continue benefiting from this premium service, you must ensure that your account balance with Horizon Bank meets the minimum requirement of {{faq_d1152d2a_002}}K for each of the {{faq_d1152d2a_003}} months. Failure to maintain this threshold will result in the automatic expiration of your premium status after the initial {{faq_d1152d2a_004}}-month period.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_8642e9f3\", \"content\": \"Question: What purposes does the Horizon Bank Savings Account serve?\\n\\nAnswer: - The Horizon Savings Account is a Singapore dollar (SGD) product designed for both saving and routine financial activities.\\n- It enables you to:\\n  • Hold and grow funds in SGD.\\n  • Settle everyday purchases in SGD using your Horizon card or a PayNow QR code.\\n  • Access cash at any Standard Chartered ATM with your Horizon card.\\n  • Send or receive SGD to and from other banks via FAST, PayNow, incoming GIRO, or salary credit.\\n  • Pay down any outstanding Horizon credit‑card balances either through scheduled autopay or one‑time payments.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Each Task Input contains `task.customer_component`: the intent\n          formulator's resolved sub-query for that task. Evaluate a task ONLY\n          against its own `customer_component` and that task's candidate\n          parents. `customer_component` may already be elaborated with\n          retr