n to buy a car.\", \"reason\": \"Customers often use general personal loans for vehicle purchases when specific auto loans are not the primary focus.\"}]}]\n\n        Terminal Unresolved Task Markers (topic/status only; never evidence):\n        []\n\n        Decline Inputs (the only source for a declined-topic explanation):\n        []\n\n        No-Info Inputs (the only source for an unavailable-information statement):\n        []\n\n        Conversational Inputs (each is a non-financial part of this turn --\n        a greeting, thanks, feeling, or off-topic remark -- the generator\n        composed its own brief reply from its \"customer_component\", there\n        is no fixed sentence to compare against):\n        []\n\n        Customer-Facing Answer:\n        \"\"\n\n        Customer-Facing Clarification:\n        \"🚗 To help you out, are you looking for information on applying for an auto loan 🚙, or do you want to know if you can use a personal loan to buy a car? 🏦✨\"\n\n        Complete Customer-Facing UI Payload:\n        \"{\"uiType\": \"blocks\", \"options\": [], \"stepDetails\": [], \"listTitle\": \"\", \"listIntro\": \"\", \"items\": [], \"extendedText\": \"\", \"listClarificationText\": \"\", \"nextActions\": [], \"responseBlocks\": [{\"type\": \"clarification\", \"text\": \"🚗 To help you out, are you looking for information on applying for an auto loan 🚙, or do you want to know if you can use a personal loan to buy a car? 🏦✨\", \"options\": [{\"label\": \"Auto Loan\", \"message\": \"I am looking for information on applying for an auto loan.\"}, {\"label\": \"Personal Loan for a car\", \"message\": \"I want to know if I can use a personal loan to buy a car.\"}]}]}\"\n        \n\n        Write each axis's own \"_reason\" field BEFORE its verdict field below,\n        and reason it through there first -- a verdict decided first and\n        explained afterward is a rationalization, not a judgment; reasoning\n        that precedes the verdict is what actua