{"timestamp": "2026-08-31T08:56:12.112+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_v21_car2", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently for whether its supplied\n        parents are response-ready: they must contain enough materially\n        relevant, grounded information for the assistant to give the customer\n        a useful FAQ response.\n\n        Original User Message (advisory context only; never use it as an\n        individual task's completeness target): i want to buy a car\n        Trusted Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nNone\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nAI: Welcome back, Benson! How can I help with your banking today? Also, you still have 3 pending Resubmit KYC Document requests — you can check them anytime from the requests icon in the top right.\n\nWould you like to continue discussing your interest in buying a car?\nUser: i want to buy a car\n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"mapping_reason\": \"The customer is requesting to apply for a loan. 'Personal_Loan' is the appropriate base product family for individual loan applications in the Matrix, and 'Application' is the corresponding intent.\", \"procedural\": \"Submit your loan application through our online portal by providing your personal details and income documentation.\", \"policy\": \"Loan eligibility is determined based on your credit history, current income level, and existing financial obligations.\", \"conceptual\": \"A personal loan is a fixed-term credit facility that provides a lump sum for major purchases.\", \"target_commercial_product\": [\"Personal_Loan\"], \"target_intent\": [\"Account Management\", \"Application\", \"Authentication And Security\", \"Eligibility\", \"Features And Limits\", \"Fees And Charges\", \"General Inquiries\", \"Interest And Rates\", \"Loan And Credit Management\", \"Rewards And Promotions\"], \"alternate_product_reason\": \"If the specific car loan product is not covered under Personal_Loan, the request could potentially be handled by general credit management services.\", \"alternate_products\": [], \"search_territory\": \"in_scope\", \"customer_component\": \"I want to apply for a car loan.\", \"direct_query\": \"I want to apply for a car loan.\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_1\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Submit your loan application through our online portal by providing your personal details and income documentation.\", \"policy\": \"Loan eligibility is determined based on your credit history, current income level, and existing financial obligations.\", \"conceptual\": \"A personal loan is a fixed-term credit facility that provides a lump sum for major purchases.\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [{\"attempt\": 1, \"status\": \"INSUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [], \"reason\": \"The supplied parents discuss general loan application processes, approval timeframes, and the ability to apply for other products if a loan is declined, but none of the parents provide specific information regarding the application process for a car loan or confirm if Horizon Bank offers car loans specifically.\", \"evidence_delta\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_75ed6e4d\", \"fact\": \"Loan approvals are typically processed and deposited into a Horizon savings account in {{faq_75ed6e4d_001}} seconds.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_f9cce3c1\", \"fact\": \"A declined loan application does not prevent the customer from applying for other Horizon Bank products.\"}]}], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_0ae0bb51\", \"content\": \"Question: Do I qualify for Horizon Bank’s Instant Loan offering?\\n\\nAnswer: - **For current Horizon Bank clients:**\\n  * You need to possess a Horizon credit card and have adequate unused credit limit.\\n- **For new applicants:**\\n  * Singapore citizens, permanent residents, and foreign nationals are all permitted to apply for the Instant Loan.\\n  * Every submission will be subject to Horizon Bank’s credit‑worthiness assessment.\\n\\nYou may request a credit facility provided you satisfy the following criteria:\\n- You are aged between {{faq_0ae0bb51_001}} and {{faq_0ae0bb51_002}} years.\\n- Your annual income is at least {{faq_0ae0bb51_003}} if you are a Singapore citizen or permanent resident.\\n- Your annual income is at least {{faq_0ae0bb51_004}} if you are a foreigner holding a valid work pass.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_5deed8da\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the process for repaying my Horizon Bank loan?\\n\\nAnswer: - The loan installment is automatically posted to your Horizon credit card statement each month, and you can clear it via that statement.\\n- Open the Horizon App, navigate to Money → Credit Card, and select Pay Credit Card.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_af0b8d7a\", \"content\": \"Question: As a new customer applying for Horizon Bank's Instant Loan, can I choose the credit limit I want for my card?\\n\\nAnswer: - Absolutely—you may set the credit limit you prefer when submitting an Instant Loan request.\\n- Please note that the approved limit must be higher than the loan amount you are requesting.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_1946c44f\", \"content\": \"Question: What steps should I follow to request an Instant Loan from Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: - Open the Horizon App, go to the **Money** menu, and select **Loan** to initiate the process.\\n- If you are not yet a Horizon customer, first download the Horizon App, then navigate to **Product Selection** and choose **Instant Loan** to begin your application.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_1_scope\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1_scope\", \"mapping_reason\": \"Since the user is interested in a major purchase like a car, they may need to manage their existing savings or liquidity to facilitate the down payment or future loan repayments. Horizon_APP provides the necessary account management tools to monitor funds for such financial commitments.\", \"procedural\": \"Link your external bank accounts to your Horizon profile for easier fund transfers, View your current account balance and transaction history through the mobile dashboard, Set up automated alerts to monitor your savings progress for upcoming major purchases\", \"policy\": \"Account linking requires verification of ownership through secure authentication protocols, Daily transfer limits apply to all outgoing payments from your savings account, Transaction history is available for the past twelve months of account activity\", \"conceptual\": \"Digital account management allows customers to oversee their financial health and liquidity in real time, Linking accounts enables seamless movement of funds between different financial institutions, Mobile banking provides secure access to account information and transaction monitoring tools\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Horizon_APP\", \"target_intent\": [\"Account Management\", \"Payments And Transfers\"], \"search_territory\": \"adjacent_scope\", \"source_task_id\": \"task_1\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_1\", \"customer_component\": \"I want to apply for a car loan.\", \"direct_query\": \"I want to apply for a car loan.\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Link your external bank accounts to your Horizon profile for easier fund transfers, View your current account balance and transaction history through the mobile dashboard, Set up automated alerts to monitor your savings progress for upcoming major purchases\", \"policy\": \"Account linking requires verification of ownership through secure authentication protocols, Daily transfer limits apply to all outgoing payments from your savings account, Transaction history is available for the past twelve months of account activity\", \"conceptual\": \"Digital account management allows customers to oversee their financial health and liquidity in real time, Linking accounts enables seamless movement of funds between different financial institutions, Mobile banking provides secure access to account information and transaction monitoring tools\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_02489175\", \"content\": \"Question: What information will be displayed when I initiate a payment to a recipient through Horizon Bank's digital banking services?\\n\\nAnswer: When sending funds to an individual recipient, you will notice that only a portion of their name is visible after entering their PayNow proxy. However, for corporate recipients, the full registered company name will be displayed as usual. This applies to all PayNow transactions, including those made using the Scan to Pay feature within the Horizon App.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_808cc867\", \"content\": \"Question: What steps do I need to take regarding my existing PayNow setup with Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: You do not need to take any action. Horizon Bank, in collaboration with the PayNow scheme operator, will handle all necessary changes seamlessly, ensuring a smooth transition for your PayNow registrations.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_68f6ae39\", \"content\": \"Question: What effects will the upcoming modifications have on my Horizon Bank account and PayNow transactions?\\n\\nAnswer: You do not need to take any steps in response to these changes. The process of sending and receiving funds through PayNow will remain unaffected for both personal and corporate users. Your existing PayNow proxies, including your mobile number, NRIC/FIN, and Virtual Payment Address (VPA), will continue to function as they do now. Starting from {{faq_68f6ae39_001}} June {{faq_68f6ae39_002}}, when someone uses PayNow to send you money through the Horizon App, they will see a partial display of your name, enhancing the payment experience.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_f87ebecc\", \"content\": \"Question: Could you provide the necessary codes for identifying Horizon Bank, including the bank code and BIC code?\\n\\nAnswer: For your reference, Horizon Bank Singapore Limited can be identified by the following codes: \\n      * Bank Name: Horizon Bank Singapore Limited\\n      * Bank Code: {{faq_f87ebecc_001}}\\n      * BIC Code: HRZNSGSG\\n      * Branch Code: {{faq_f87ebecc_002}}\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Each Task Input contains `task.customer_component`: the intent\n          formulator's resolved sub-query for that task. Evaluate a task ONLY\n          against its own `customer_component` and that task's candidate\n          parents. `customer_component` may already be elaborated with\n          retrieval-oriented wording the customer never actually said, so\n          if you set `unresolved_term` below, derive it by reasoning\n          directly against Original User Message and Trusted Conversation\n          Context instead -- never by quoting `customer_component` back --\n          a clarifying question must quote something the customer will\n          recognize as their own.\n        - Each Task Input may include `prior_sufficiency_audit_history` from\n          earlier attempts for the same task in this turn. Read it before\n          judging the current candidates and remain consistent with its prior\n          sufficiency judgments. This history is internal audit context only;\n          it is not customer-facing evidence and does not authorize any new\n          factual claim.\n        - Classify each task as SUFFICIENT, PARTIALLY_SUFFICIENT, or\n          INSUFFICIENT. Judge whether the supplied parents provide useful,\n          materially relevant information for the task—not whether they repeat\n          the customer's wording or explicitly resolve every possible\n          interpretation of the customer's question.\n        - TERRITORY CEILING (Extra Effort v2.0): when `task.search_territory`\n          is `\"adjacent_scope\"`, this task is a deliberate scope-expansion\n          companion -- by construction, its own product/intent is DIFFERENT\n          from what the customer literally asked about, offered only as\n          related information that might still help. Its status may never\n          be SUFFICIENT, no matter how well its parents match it -- cap at\n          PARTIALLY_SUFFICIENT when they contain a genuinely useful related\n          fact, INSUFFICIENT when they don't. A normal task\n          (`search_territory` absent or `\"in_scope\"`) has no such ceiling.\n          Never set `likely_ambiguous_request`/`unresolved_term` for an\n          `\"adjacent_scope\"` task either -- clarification-authoring for\n          this subquery belongs exclusively to its `\"in_scope\"` sibling\n          task, which reviews the same underlying request.\n        - PARTIAL-EVIDENCE DECISION ORDER: First identify whether any supplied\n          parent contains a factual proposition directly relevant to a\n          meaningful aspect of the customer's resolved request. If one does,\n          do not return INSUFFICIENT merely because the parent cannot determine\n          the customer's requested outcome, permission, eligibility,\n          exception, legality, preferred action, or other broader conclusion.\n          Retain that parent as PARTIALLY_SUFFICIENT when its supported fact\n          can be truthfully presented as useful, bounded Horizon guidance\n          while another material aspect remains unresolved. Continue retrieval\n          for the unresolved aspect.\n        - Return INSUFFICIENT only when no supplied parent contains any\n          factual proposition that can be truthfully and materially presented\n          in relation to the resolved request. A parent is