ith another bank, opening the Horizon App, tapping the Payments tab, selecting \"Register for PayNow\" if you haven't already, completing the registration, and sending a PayNow payment to that registered mobile number or NRIC/FIN so the funds appear in your savings account.\nUser: do you have loan that can finance my car?\nAI: I don't currently have information available on whether Horizon Bank offers a car loan to finance the purchase of a vehicle! 🚗\nUser: can your personal loan be used to buy car?\n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"mapping_reason\": \"The user is asking about the permitted usage of a Personal_Loan for a specific purpose (car purchase), which falls under the Features And Limits intent for the Personal_Loan product.\", \"procedural\": \"Review the loan agreement terms and conditions to identify permitted and restricted uses of loan funds.\", \"policy\": \"Personal loan funds are subject to specific usage restrictions and may not be applicable for all purchases.\", \"conceptual\": \"A personal loan is an unsecured credit facility that provides funds for various personal financial needs and goals.\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Personal_Loan\", \"target_intent\": [\"Features And Limits\"], \"alternate_product_reason\": \"If the personal loan documentation does not explicitly cover car financing, the Horizon_APP might contain general information on managing loan funds or alternative financing resources.\", \"alternate_products\": [\"Horizon_APP\"], \"search_territory\": \"in_scope\", \"customer_component\": \"Can the Horizon Bank personal loan be used to finance the purchase of a car?\", \"direct_query\": \"Can the Horizon Bank personal loan be used to finance the purchase of a car?\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_1\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Review the loan agreement terms and conditions to identify permitted and restricted uses of loan funds.\", \"policy\": \"Personal loan funds are subject to specific usage restrictions and may not be applicable for all purchases.\", \"conceptual\": \"A personal loan is an unsecured credit facility that provides funds for various personal financial needs and goals.\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_0ae0bb51\", \"content\": \"Question: Do I qualify for Horizon Bank’s Instant Loan offering?\\n\\nAnswer: - **For current Horizon Bank clients:**\\n  * You need to possess a Horizon credit card and have adequate unused credit limit.\\n- **For new applicants:**\\n  * Singapore citizens, permanent residents, and foreign nationals are all permitted to apply for the Instant Loan.\\n  * Every submission will be subject to Horizon Bank’s credit‑worthiness assessment.\\n\\nYou may request a credit facility provided you satisfy the following criteria:\\n- You are aged between {{faq_0ae0bb51_001}} and {{faq_0ae0bb51_002}} years.\\n- Your annual income is at least {{faq_0ae0bb51_003}} if you are a Singapore citizen or permanent resident.\\n- Your annual income is at least {{faq_0ae0bb51_004}} if you are a foreigner holding a valid work pass.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_952e4559\", \"content\": \"Question: What does Horizon Bank’s Instant Loan product involve?\\n\\nAnswer: Instant Loan is a Horizon Bank offering in Singapore that enables you to convert a portion of the available credit on your Horizon credit card into cash.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_17e5c35a\", \"content\": \"Question: Why does my Instant Loan application come with a Horizon credit card and a Horizon savings account?\\n\\nAnswer: - Horizon Bank converts a portion of the available balance on your Horizon credit card into cash and deposits those funds directly into your Horizon savings account.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_1946c44f\", \"content\": \"Question: What steps should I follow to request an Instant Loan from Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: - Open the Horizon App, go to the **Money** menu, and select **Loan** to initiate the process.\\n- If you are not yet a Horizon customer, first download the Horizon App, then navigate to **Product Selection** and choose **Instant Loan** to begin your application.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Each Task Input contains `task.customer_component`: the intent\n          formulator's resolved sub-query for that task. Evaluate a task ONLY\n          against its own `customer_component` and that task's candidate\n          parents. `customer_component` may already be elaborated with\n          retrieval-oriented wording the customer never actually said, so\n          if you set `unresolved_term` below, derive it by reasoning\n          directly against Original User Message and Trusted Conversation\n          Context instead -- never by quoting `customer_component` back --\n          a clarifying question must quote something the customer will\n          recognize as their own.\n        - Each Task Input may include `prior_sufficiency_audit_history` from\n          earlier attempts for the same task in this turn. Read it before\n          judging the current candidates and remain consistent with its prior\n          sufficiency judgments. This history is internal audit context only;\n          it is not customer-facing evidence and does not authorize any new\n          factual claim.\n        - Classify each task as SUFFICIENT, PARTIALLY_SUFFICIENT, or\n          INSUFFICIENT. Judge whether the supplied parents provide useful,\n          materially relevant information for the task—not whether they repeat\n          the customer's wording or explicitly resolve every possible\n          interpretation of the customer's question.\n        - TERRITORY CEILING (Extra Effort v2.0): when `task.search_territory`\n          is `\"adjacent_scope\"`, this task is a deliberate scope-expansion\n          companion -- by construction, its own product/intent is DIFFERENT\n          from what the