ion available regarding: Can a Horizon personal loan be used to purchase a car?.\"}]\n\n        Conversational Inputs (each is a non-financial part of this turn --\n        a greeting, thanks, feeling, or off-topic remark -- the generator\n        composed its own brief reply from its \"customer_component\", there\n        is no fixed sentence to compare against):\n        []\n\n        Customer-Facing Answer:\n        \"\"\n\n        Customer-Facing Clarification:\n        \"I don't currently have information available on whether a Horizon personal loan can be used to purchase a car! 🚗\"\n\n        Complete Customer-Facing UI Payload:\n        \"{\"uiType\": \"blocks\", \"options\": [], \"stepDetails\": [], \"listTitle\": \"\", \"listIntro\": \"\", \"items\": [], \"extendedText\": \"\", \"listClarificationText\": \"\", \"nextActions\": [], \"responseBlocks\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"I don't currently have information available on whether a Horizon personal loan can be used to purchase a car! 🚗\", \"options\": []}]}\"\n        \n\n        Write each axis's own \"_reason\" field BEFORE its verdict field below,\n        and reason it through there first -- a verdict decided first and\n        explained afterward is a rationalization, not a judgment; reasoning\n        that precedes the verdict is what actually shapes it.\n\n        Output JSON only:\n        {\"conduct_reason\": \"...\", \"conduct_compliant\": true/false, \"conduct_violations\": [{\"rule\": \"bank_conduct\" | \"regulation\", \"violation\": \"...\", \"unsupported_content\": [\"verbatim phrase\"]}], \"answer_compliant\": true/false, \"clarification_compliant\": true/false, \"rewrite_instruction\": \"...\", \"evidence_reason\": \"...\", \"evidence_grounded\": true/false, \"evidence_violations\": [{\"scope\": \"...\", \"unsupported_content\": [\"verbatim phrase\"], \"evidence_gap\": \"...\"}], \"answer_evidence_grounded\": true/false, \"answer_bridge_grounded\": true/false, \"clarification_groun