{"timestamp": "2026-08-31T12:28:50.960+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_1ef06da3-cc8d-4337-9c0a-de1b51fb58de", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently for whether its supplied\n        parents are response-ready: they must contain enough materially\n        relevant, grounded information for the assistant to give the customer\n        a useful FAQ response.\n\n        Original User Message (advisory context only; never use it as an\n        individual task's completeness target): i want to buy a car\n        Trusted Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nNone\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nAI: Welcome back, Benson! How can I help with your banking today? Also, you still have 3 pending Resubmit KYC Document requests — you can check them anytime from the requests icon in the top right.\nUser: i want to buy a car\n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"mapping_reason\": \"The customer is requesting a loan for a specific purpose (car). Within the Product/Intent Matrix, Personal_Loan is the appropriate base product for individual lending, and 'apply' maps directly to the Application intent.\", \"procedural\": \"Submit the online application form with your personal identification and proof of income documents.\", \"policy\": \"Applicants must meet minimum age and income requirements to qualify for a personal loan.\", \"conceptual\": \"A personal loan provides a lump sum of funds for major purchases, repaid in monthly installments.\", \"target_commercial_product\": [\"Personal_Loan\"], \"target_intent\": [\"Account Management\", \"Application\", \"Authentication And Security\", \"Eligibility\", \"Features And Limits\", \"Fees And Charges\", \"General Inquiries\", \"Interest And Rates\", \"Loan And Credit Management\", \"Rewards And Promotions\"], \"alternate_product_reason\": \"While the request is for a car loan, if the bank's personal loan documentation does not cover vehicle-specific financing, the request could be handled as a general inquiry.\", \"alternate_products\": [], \"search_territory\": \"in_scope\", \"customer_component\": \"I would like to apply for a car loan.\", \"direct_query\": \"I would like to apply for a car loan.\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_1\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Submit the online application form with your personal identification and proof of income documents.\", \"policy\": \"Applicants must meet minimum age and income requirements to qualify for a personal loan.\", \"conceptual\": \"A personal loan provides a lump sum of funds for major purchases, repaid in monthly installments.\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [{\"attempt\": 1, \"status\": \"INSUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [], \"reason\": \"The supplied parents discuss general loan application processes, approval timeframes, and the ability to apply for other products if a loan is declined, but none of the parents provide information specific to applying for a car loan or confirm if Horizon Bank offers vehicle-specific financing.\", \"evidence_delta\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_75ed6e4d\", \"fact\": \"Most loans are approved and deposited into a Horizon savings account in about {{faq_75ed6e4d_001}} seconds.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_f9cce3c1\", \"fact\": \"A declined loan does not prevent an applicant from applying for other Horizon Bank products.\"}]}], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_0ae0bb51\", \"content\": \"Question: Do I qualify for Horizon Bank’s Instant Loan offering?\\n\\nAnswer: - **For current Horizon Bank clients:**\\n  * You need to possess a Horizon credit card and have adequate unused credit limit.\\n- **For new applicants:**\\n  * Singapore citizens, permanent residents, and foreign nationals are all permitted to apply for the Instant Loan.\\n  * Every submission will be subject to Horizon Bank’s credit‑worthiness assessment.\\n\\nYou may request a credit facility provided you satisfy the following criteria:\\n- You are aged between {{faq_0ae0bb51_001}} and {{faq_0ae0bb51_002}} years.\\n- Your annual income is at least {{faq_0ae0bb51_003}} if you are a Singapore citizen or permanent resident.\\n- Your annual income is at least {{faq_0ae0bb51_004}} if you are a foreigner holding a valid work pass.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_1946c44f\", \"content\": \"Question: What steps should I follow to request an Instant Loan from Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: - Open the Horizon App, go to the **Money** menu, and select **Loan** to initiate the process.\\n- If you are not yet a Horizon customer, first download the Horizon App, then navigate to **Product Selection** and choose **Instant Loan** to begin your application.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_1_scope\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1_scope\", \"mapping_reason\": \"Since the user wants to buy a car, they will need to manage the funds for the purchase and subsequent monthly repayments. The Horizon_APP provides the necessary platform for managing these funds and tracking payment schedules, which is a functional adjacent service to the loan application process.\", \"procedural\": \"Link your loan account to the mobile application for automated monthly repayment tracking and balance monitoring.\", \"policy\": \"Mobile banking access requires active authentication credentials and is subject to standard digital transaction security protocols.\", \"conceptual\": \"The mobile application serves as a centralized hub for monitoring loan balances and managing recurring payment transfers.\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Horizon_APP\", \"target_intent\": [\"Account Management\", \"Payments And Transfers\"], \"search_territory\": \"adjacent_scope\", \"source_task_id\": \"task_1\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_1\", \"customer_component\": \"I would like to apply for a car loan.\", \"direct_query\": \"I would like to apply for a car loan.\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Link your loan account to the mobile application for automated monthly repayment tracking and balance monitoring.\", \"policy\": \"Mobile banking access requires active authentication credentials and is subject to standard digital transaction security protocols.\", \"conceptual\": \"The mobile application serves as a centralized hub for monitoring loan balances and managing recurring payment transfers.\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_02489175\", \"content\": \"Question: What information will be displayed when I initiate a payment to a recipient through Horizon Bank's digital banking services?\\n\\nAnswer: When sending funds to an individual recipient, you will notice that only a portion of their name is visible after entering their PayNow proxy. However, for corporate recipients, the full registered company name will be displayed as usual. This applies to all PayNow transactions, including those made using the Scan to Pay feature within the Horizon App.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_f87ebecc\", \"content\": \"Question: Could you provide the necessary codes for identifying Horizon Bank, including the bank code and BIC code?\\n\\nAnswer: For your reference, Horizon Bank Singapore Limited can be identified by the following codes: \\n      * Bank Name: Horizon Bank Singapore Limited\\n      * Bank Code: {{faq_f87ebecc_001}}\\n      * BIC Code: HRZNSGSG\\n      * Branch Code: {{faq_f87ebecc_002}}\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_88851d34\", \"content\": \"Question: Why doesn’t my bus or MRT ride show up in the Horizon App after I tap out at the fare gate?\\n\\nAnswer: - Transit fares are tallied on a daily basis and posted to your Horizon card the following day. For instance, rides taken today are usually reflected on your statement tomorrow morning. In occasional instances, the posting may be delayed further, depending on when the transit operator finalises its settlement.\\n- To see a itemised list of your bus and MRT journeys, you can log into the SimplyGo app or access the SimplyGo portal.\\n- These travel payments are processed as offline transactions, meaning there is no instant link between the transport system and Horizon. The data is captured at the point of tap‑out, then aggregated and charged as a single fare batch the next day.\\n- Charges will only be applied to your Horizon card while it remains active and unlocked, which aligns with industry standards. If the card is locked or blocked, no additional travel transactions can be posted to it.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_808cc867\", \"content\": \"Question: What steps do I need to take regarding my existing PayNow setup with Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: You do not need to take any action. Horizon Bank, in collaboration with the PayNow scheme operator, will handle all necessary changes seamlessly, ensuring a smooth transition for your PayNow registrations.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Each Task Input contains `task.customer_component`: the intent\n          formulator's resolved sub-query for that task. Evaluate a task ONLY\n          against its own `customer_component` and that task's candidate\n          parents. `customer_component` may already be elaborated with\n          retrieval-oriented wording the customer never actually said, so\n          if you set `unresolved_term` below, derive it by reasoning\n          directly against Original User Message and Trusted Conversation\n          Context instead -- never by quoting `customer_component` back --\n          a clarifying question must quote something the customer will\n          recognize as their own.\