{"timestamp": "2026-08-31T13:32:43.856+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_cdc9d5a8-6c24-4d48-b30d-ac9a21846ab7", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently for whether its supplied\n        parents are response-ready: they must contain enough materially\n        relevant, grounded information for the assistant to give the customer\n        a useful FAQ response.\n\n        Original User Message (advisory context only; never use it as an\n        individual task's completeness target): I am asking about using my savings account for buying a house.\n        Trusted Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nNone\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nAI: Welcome back, Benson! How can I help with your banking today? Also, you still have 3 pending Resubmit KYC Document requests — you can check them anytime from the requests icon in the top right.\n\nWould you like to continue discussing your options for funding your car purchase with a personal loan or your savings?\nUser: can i buy a house\nAI: To help you with buying a house, are you asking about a personal loan or using your savings account? 🏡\nUser: I am asking about a personal loan to help with buying a house.\nAI: Loan Eligibility Criteria: For current Horizon Bank clients, you need to possess a Horizon credit card and have an adequate unused credit limit. For new applicants, Singapore citizens, permanent residents, and foreign nationals are all permitted to apply, and every submission is subject to Horizon Bank's credit-worthiness assessment. You may request a credit facility provided you satisfy the following criteria: you are aged between 21 and 65 years; your annual income is at least S$30,000 if you are a Singapore citizen or permanent resident; or your annual income is at least S$60,000 if you are a foreigner holding a valid work pass.\nApproval and Deposit Timeframe: The vast majority of loans are approved and the amount is deposited into your Horizon savings account in about 60 seconds.\nUser: I am asking about using my savings account for buying a house.\n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"mapping_reason\": \"The customer is inquiring about the usage of their 'savings account' (Deposit_Account) for a specific financial goal (buying a house). 'General Inquiries' is the appropriate intent for understanding how a savings account can be utilized for such purposes.\", \"procedural\": \"Access your savings account balance and transaction history through the Horizon mobile app or online banking portal.\", \"policy\": \"Savings accounts are subject to minimum balance requirements and applicable interest rate structures as defined by account terms.\", \"conceptual\": \"A savings account is a deposit account designed for holding funds securely while earning interest over time.\", \"target_commercial_product\": [\"Deposit_Account\", \"Horizon_APP\"], \"target_intent\": [\"Account Management\", \"Application\", \"Authentication And Security\", \"Branch And ATM Locator\", \"Card Logistics\", \"Eligibility\", \"Features And Limits\", \"Fees And Charges\", \"General Inquiries\", \"Interest And Rates\", \"Payments And Transfers\", \"Profile Updates\", \"Rewards And Promotions\", \"Transaction Disputes\"], \"alternate_product_reason\": \"If the inquiry relates to the digital management of the account for this goal, the Horizon_APP is a plausible functional alternative.\", \"alternate_products\": [\"Horizon_APP\"], \"search_territory\": \"in_scope\", \"customer_component\": \"I am asking about using my savings account for buying a house.\", \"direct_query\": \"I am asking about using my savings account for buying a house.\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_1\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Access your savings account balance and transaction history through the Horizon mobile app or online banking portal.\", \"policy\": \"Savings accounts are subject to minimum balance requirements and applicable interest rate structures as defined by account terms.\", \"conceptual\": \"A savings account is a deposit account designed for holding funds securely while earning interest over time.\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [{\"attempt\": 1, \"status\": \"INSUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [], \"reason\": \"The supplied parents provide information about opening accounts, credit card eligibility, and recurring transfers, but none of the parents address the specific inquiry regarding using a savings account for the purpose of buying a house. There is no information on whether savings accounts can be used for house deposits or if there are specific procedures for such a transaction.\", \"evidence_delta\": []}], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_26880b57\", \"content\": \"Question: What advantages and functionalities does Horizon Bank’s savings account provide?\\n\\nAnswer: - Tailored growth options: Select a savings plan that best matches your goals and earn interest on the balance you keep. Enjoy a rate of up to {{faq_26880b57_001}} per annum on the first {{faq_26880b57_002}}, with any amount above that earning {{faq_26880b57_003}} p.a.\\n- Completely fee‑free: Horizon Bank imposes no hidden charges—no minimum‑balance penalty, no fall‑below fee, no monthly maintenance fee, no account‑closure fee, no foreign‑exchange surcharge, and no annual debit‑card fee.\\n- Dedicated debit card:\\n  * Instant virtual card: Receive a digital card immediately for online purchases while you wait for the physical card.\\n  * Easy physical‑card activation: Tap the card to the back of your phone (NFC) for automatic activation, or use the activation code supplied in your welcome pack if your device lacks NFC.\\n  * Custom PIN setup: Choose a six‑digit PIN through the Horizon App to secure ATM transactions.\\n  * Number‑less design: The card’s number is stored securely in the Horizon App, reducing the risk of theft or fraud.\\n- Convenient cash access: Withdraw funds at Horizon Bank’s ATM inside FairPrice Xtra VivoCity or at any Standard Chartered ATM nationwide.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_d158d0e5\", \"content\": \"Question: What advantages and functionalities does Horizon Bank's savings account provide?\\n\\nAnswer: - Tailored savings plans that let you earn interest on your deposits, with a rate of up to {{faq_d158d0e5_001}} on the first {{faq_d158d0e5_002}} and {{faq_d158d0e5_003}} p.a. on any amount above that threshold.\\n- Completely fee‑free: no hidden charges, no minimum‑balance penalties, no monthly service fee, no account‑closure fee, no foreign‑exchange fee, and no annual debit‑card fee.\\n- Your own Horizon debit card, offering:\\n  * Instant virtual card: receive a digital card instantly via the Horizon App for online purchases before the physical card arrives.\\n  * Physical card activation via NFC or activation code: tap the card to the back of an NFC‑enabled phone for automatic activation, or use the code provided in your welcome pack if your phone lacks NFC.\\n  * PIN configuration: set a six‑digit PIN within the Horizon App to securely conduct ATM transactions.\\n  * Numberless design: the card number is hidden to protect against theft and fraud, and can be viewed anytime in the Horizon App.\\n- Easy cash access: withdraw funds from your savings account at Horizon’s ATM inside FairPrice Xtra VivoCity or at any Standard Chartered ATM.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_48ced7a5\", \"content\": \"Question: What can I do with a Horizon Bank Savings Account?\\n\\nAnswer: - The Horizon Bank Savings Account is denominated in Singapore dollars (SGD) and is designed for both saving and routine financial activities.\\n- Store funds in SGD.\\n- Settle everyday purchases in SGD using your Horizon card or a PayNow QR code.\\n- Access cash at any Standard Chartered ATM using the Horizon card.\\n- Send or receive SGD to and from other banks via FAST, PayNow, incoming GIRO, or salary crediting.\\n- Pay off outstanding balances on your Horizon credit card either through scheduled autopay or one‑time payments.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_70aebcd6\", \"content\": \"Question: What information and tools are necessary to open a Savings Account with Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: - A mobile phone together with MyInfo verification to auto‑populate your application form.\\n- If you delete or reinstall the Horizon App after successfully registering, you will still need to authenticate via SingPass when you log in again.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_1_scope\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1_scope\", \"mapping_reason\": \"Since the customer is interested in using savings for a house purchase, they may require a Personal_Loan to bridge the gap between their current savings and the total property cost, making 'Loan And Credit Management' a relevant adjacent scope.\", \"procedural\": \"Review your eligibility for a home loan by checking your credit score and current debt obligations.\", \"policy\": \"Personal loans for property acquisition are subject to specific interest rates and repayment tenure constraints.\", \"conceptual\": \"A personal loan provides additional capital to supplement existing savings for major financial commitments like home purchases.\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Personal_Loan\", \"target_intent\": [\"Loan And Credit Management\"], \"search_territory\": \"adjacent_scope\", \"source_task_id\": \"task_1\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_1\", \"customer_component\": \"I am asking about using my savings account for buying a house.\", \"direct_query\": \"I am asking about using my savings account for buying a house.\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Review your eligibility for a home loan by checking your credit score and current debt obligations.\", \"policy\": \"Personal loans for property acquisition are subject to specific interest rates and repayment tenure constraints.\", \"conceptual\": \"A personal loan provides additional capital to supplement existing savings for major financial commitments like home purchases.\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_5deed8da\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the process for repaying my Horizon Bank loan?\\n\\nAnswer: - The loan installment is automatically posted to your Horizon credit card statement each month, and you can clear it via that statement.\\n- Open the Horizon App, navigate to Money → Credit Card, and select Pay Credit Card.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_1b6980e9\", \"content\": \"Question: What charges does Horizon Bank impose for paying off a loan ahead of schedule?\\n\\nAnswer: - Horizon Bank levies a {{faq_1b6980e9_001}} early repayment fee on the outstanding principal amount when the loan is settled before its scheduled maturity.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_46c17d0e\", \"content\": \"Question: What steps do I need to take to initiate a balance transfer request with Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: To begin the balance transfer process, navigate to the Horizon App, select the 'More' option, and then proceed to the 'Loan' section, where you will find 'Other Flexible Loans' to commence your application.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_02ad328e\", \"content\": \"Question: What are the consequences if I fail to pay the entire loan installment by the due date?\\n\\nAnswer: - If the installment is not fully settled by the scheduled due date, the remaining principal will accrue interest at a daily rate of {{faq_02ad328e_001}} (equivalent to {{faq_02ad328e_002}} per annum) until Horizon Bank receives the payment. *Effective {{faq_02ad328e_003}} July {{faq_02ad328e_004}}, Horizon Bank will personalize the credit‑card Effective Interest Rate according to each customer’s credit behaviour, with rates ranging from {{faq_02ad328e_005}} to {{faq_02ad328e_006}} per annum.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Each Task Input contains `task.customer_component`: the intent\n          formulator's resolved sub-query for that task. Evaluate a task ONLY\n          against its own `customer_component` and that task's candidate\n          parents. `customer_component` may already be elaborated with\n          retrieval-oriented wording the customer never actually said, so\n          if you set `unresolved_term` below, derive it by reasoning\n          directly against Original User Message and Trusted Conversation\n          Context instead -- never by quoting `customer_component` back --\n          a clarifying question must quote something the customer will\n          recognize as their own.\n        - Each Task Input may include `prior_sufficiency_audit_history` from\n          earlier attempts for the same task in this turn. Read it before\n          judging the current candidates and remain consistent with its prior\n          sufficiency judgments. This history is internal audit context only;\n          it is not customer-facing evidence and does not authorize any new\n          factual claim.\n        - Classify each task as SUFFICIENT, PARTIALLY_SUFFICIENT, or\n          INSUFFICIENT. Judge whether the supplied parents provide useful,\n          materially relevant information for the task—not whether they repeat\n          the customer's wording or explicitly resolve every possible\n          interpretation of the customer's question.\n        - TERRITORY CEILING (Extra Effort v2.0): when `task.search_territory`\n          is `\"adjacent_scope\"`, this task is a deliberate scope-expansion\n          companion -- by construction, its own product/intent is DIFFERENT\n          from what the customer literally asked about,